{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/49880a41170576b9e71a1516988ce0e7.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game (with the exception of the Main Menu, the UI, and the pinging ability) contains complete silence and loud jumpscares!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/233272b2ebe943f0c9b24697ef128061.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrens Of Random is a first-person, minimalistic horror game where you must escape 20 mazes that vary in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/b86d33bf8b50e93d053876037c6dbb42.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you exit a maze, there's a chance that you'll spawn in a random maze and must survive the previous or future maze twice, so even though you'll survive more than 20 times, you must survive in order, from Maze 1 to Maze 20.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/d2943f2878aad5f2f130f3f9fee8b9dd.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The default mode is  <strong>Normal</strong> mode, so if you want a challenge, go ahead and try\u00a0<strong>Hardcore</strong> mode or\u00a0<strong>Speedrunner</strong> mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Normal mode, you have 3 lives, can ping the exit every 5 minutes, and your game will save when you exit to the main menu. This is so you can familiarize yourself with the mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hardcore mode, you have 1 life, a higher chance of random spawns, and the exit also spawns in random locations when a random spawn happens. Your\u00a0game will still save when you exit to the main menu, but you cannot ping the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedrunner mode, you have 1 life, no saves, no pinging, and no random spawns, just finish the game as fast as you can.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098870?t=1771975582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/be33bd9f8fcfb7042806ea44307e68473e41e42d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771975582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/070d31ab29fcaccdacbc7e12bc6b1ad7e3555868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771975582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/070d31ab29fcaccdacbc7e12bc6b1ad7e3555868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771975582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/49880a41170576b9e71a1516988ce0e7.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game (with the exception of the Main Menu, the UI, and the pinging ability) contains complete silence and loud jumpscares!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/233272b2ebe943f0c9b24697ef128061.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrens Of Random is a first-person, minimalistic horror game where you must escape 20 mazes that vary in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/18c00134d4a0bb581d7e21e6a992457a.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/b86d33bf8b50e93d053876037c6dbb42.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you exit a maze, there's a chance that you'll spawn in a random maze and must survive the previous or future maze twice, so even though you'll survive more than 20 times, you must survive in order, from Maze 1 to Maze 20.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/95387cd9fe9dfee9b130d8cd367dadaa.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/d2943f2878aad5f2f130f3f9fee8b9dd.avif?t=1771975582\" width=672 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The default mode is  <strong>Normal</strong> mode, so if you want a challenge, go ahead and try\u00a0<strong>Hardcore</strong> mode or\u00a0<strong>Speedrunner</strong> mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Normal mode, you have 3 lives, can ping the exit every 5 minutes, and your game will save when you exit to the main menu. This is so you can familiarize yourself with the mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.poster.avif?t=1771975582\" width=570 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.webm?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/extras/3dff4f28136bd1ea01608e73cd88a1e5.mp4?t=1771975582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hardcore mode, you have 1 life, a higher chance of random spawns, and the exit also spawns in random locations when a random spawn happens. Your\u00a0game will still save when you exit to the main menu, but you cannot ping the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedrunner mode, you have 1 life, no saves, no pinging, and no random spawns, just finish the game as fast as you can.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Saudade Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/6c9a3708f91b407e797e5cc4f4c6261cc1518892/header.jpg?t=1771975582","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2026 Saudade Software, LLC. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04/24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 or AMD Radeon RX 6800<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Commendable Hearing</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070/5070 or AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Impeccable Hearing</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098870/1062362563/413f90837da558b1545aea1a3db40e6e96408587/1761945389/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761945979","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/409